# v2 UI

- Design spec: `docs/langify-v2/05-design-system.md` and `06-screens.md`. The visual reference is `design/reference/01-content-page-possessives.png` (content pages) and `02-conjugation-endings.png` (verb pages), Warm Editorial look; Stitch HTML in `design/stitch-html/`. Never use colors from `design/archive-v4/`.
- Mobile-first web app: the v2 layout is RTL (`dir="rtl"`), with a 390px design width and a centered column of at most 480px. Target-language text is LTR per segment through RichText. Tokens are CSS variables via Tailwind 4 `@theme`; no hex values in components.
- Fonts via next/font: Newsreader (display + target text), Noto Sans Arabic (all Arabic), Inter (UI Latin). Colors: cream paper, deep teal primary, coral actions, mustard notes — tokens in 05, never hex in components.
- One tab bar: المسار · الكروت · المكتبة · أنا. No phone status bar drawn in screens. No English or Spanish UI strings; UI copy goes through i18n.
- Guided pages: unrevealed parts at 20% opacity, the active target with a pale-yellow fill and an amber border, and a caption bar that never covers content (add bottom padding).
- Flashcard front: the word and audio only, with no autoplay. Irregular forms are purple with ⚡; verb endings are colored by class (-ar coral, -er teal, -ir gold).
- Practice: the character speaks in white bubbles (target language only); the coach speaks only in the mustard NoteCard with a skill chip.
